{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2022-06-22 08:00:00', 'title': 'PEAK ROCK CAPITAL AFFILIATE SELLS TNT CRUST TO GENERAL MILLS', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS , JUNE 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AN AFFILIATE OF PEAK ROCK CAPITAL ("PEAK ROCK"), A LEADING MIDDLE-MARKET PRIVATE INVESTMENT FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CLOSE OF ITS SALE OF TNT CRUST LLC ("TNT" OR THE "COMPANY") TO GENERAL MILLS, INC. (NYSE: GIS). HEADQUARTERED IN ST. CHARLES, MISSOURI, TNT IS A LEADING PROVIDER OF PARTIALLY BAKED, SELF-RISING, AND BETTER-FOR-YOU PIZZA CRUSTS.'}